# AI Ticket Classification & CRM Automation

## Overview
This project demonstrates an AI-powered support ticket classification and CRM automation workflow using n8n.

## Features
- Automated support ticket processing
- AI-based ticket classification
- Ticket data organization
- CRM workflow automation
- Reduced manual ticket handling

## Tools & Technologies
- n8n
- AI Integration
- API Integrations
- Google Sheets
- CRM Automation

## Project Purpose
The purpose of this project is to explore how AI and workflow automation can improve support ticket management.

## Project Type
Learning / Demo Project
